curity Council Renews Haiti Gang Suppression Force for Six Months","url":"https://press.un.org/en/2026/sc16466.doc.htm","date":"2026-09-29T18:45:37Z","kind":"aprovada","source":"press.un.org","tags":[],"veto_by":[],"summary":"The Security Council today renewed the mandate of the Gang Suppression Force in Haiti for six months, as speakers called for its rapid deployment to reclaim territory from armed gangs, restore State authority and create conditions for elections."},{"title":"Haiti: Vote on a Draft Resolution Extending the Mandate of the Gang Suppression Force and UN Support Office*","url":"https://www.securitycouncilreport.org/whatsinblue/2026/09/haiti-vote-on-a-draft-resolution-extending-the-mandate-of-the-gang-suppression-force-and-un-support-office.php","date":"2026-09-29T01:18:55Z","kind":"votacao","source":"Security Council Report","tags":[],"veto_by":[],"summary":"Tomorrow morning (29 September), the Security Council is expected to vote on a draft resolution extending the mandate of the Gang Suppression Force (GSF) for another six months, until 31 March 2027. The draft resolution also requests the Secretary-General to..."},{"title":"Democratic Republic of the Congo: Briefing and Consultations","url":"https://www.securitycouncilreport.org/whatsinblue/2026/09/democratic-republic-of-the-congo-briefing-and-consultations-22.php","date":"2026-09-28T23:47:38Z","kind":"reuniao","source":"Security Council Report","tags":["africa"],"veto_by":[],"summary":"Tomorrow morning (29 September), the Security Council will convene for an open briefing and closed consultations on the situation in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC), including the work of the UN Organization Stabilization Mission in the Democratic Republic..."},{"title":"Security Council, 10232nd Meeting (AM) Democratic Republic of the Congo/MONUSCO","url":"https://press.un.org/en/blog/sc16467","date":"2026-09-28T23:02:53Z","kind":"reuniao","source":"press.un.org","tags":["africa"],"veto_by":[],"summary"